  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the comal to medium-high heat",
    "Thread the beef, grape tomatoes, onion, and bell pepper onto skewers",
    "Brush the skewers with olive oil and season with salt, garlic, and black pepper",
    "Cook the skewers for 10 minutes, turning occasionally",
    "Check the internal temperature of the beef to ensure it reaches 145 degrees",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving",
    "Serve the skewers hot, garnished with fresh parsley if desired"
